%% 회원가입 → User/Profile 동시 생성 → 로그인 시 profile_id 포함 토큰 발급 흐름
%% 2026-07-07 SQLAlchemy+Alembic 전환, User/Profile 분리와 함께 새로 작성 (기존 6개 arch_*.mermaid엔 없던 플로우)
%% 실제 코드: app/services/auth.py, app/repositories/user_repository.py, app/repositories/profile_repository.py,
%%           app/services/jwt.py, app/core/jwt/tokens.py, app/dependencies/security.py

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 프론트(React)
    participant AuthRouter as auth_routers.py<br/>(POST /auth/signup)
    participant AuthSvc as AuthService
    participant UserRepo as UserRepository
    participant ProfileRepo as ProfileRepository
    participant DB as MySQL<br/>(users, profiles)

    Client->>AuthRouter: email/password/name/gender/birth_date/phone_number
    AuthRouter->>AuthSvc: signup(session, data)
    AuthSvc->>UserRepo: exists_by_email(session, email)
    UserRepo->>DB: SELECT users WHERE email=?
    DB-->>UserRepo: 없음
    AuthSvc->>ProfileRepo: exists_by_phone_number(session, phone)
    ProfileRepo->>DB: SELECT profiles WHERE phone_number=?
    DB-->>ProfileRepo: 없음
    AuthSvc->>UserRepo: create_user(session, email, hashed_password)
    UserRepo->>DB: INSERT users (계정만)
    AuthSvc->>ProfileRepo: create_profile(session, user_id, name, ..., relation=SELF)
    ProfileRepo->>DB: INSERT profiles (relation=SELF, user_id=방금 만든 User.id)
    AuthSvc->>DB: COMMIT (User+Profile 한 트랜잭션)
    AuthRouter-->>Client: 201 Created

    Note over Client,DB: 로그인 시 — user_id뿐 아니라 profile_id도 JWT에 담는다

    participant AuthRouter2 as auth_routers.py<br/>(POST /auth/login)
    participant JwtSvc as JwtService

    Client->>AuthRouter2: email/password
    AuthRouter2->>AuthSvc: authenticate(session, data) → User
    AuthRouter2->>AuthSvc: login(session, user)
    AuthSvc->>ProfileRepo: get_default_profile_for_user(session, user.id)
    ProfileRepo->>DB: SELECT profiles WHERE user_id=? AND relation='SELF'
    DB-->>ProfileRepo: Profile
    AuthSvc->>JwtSvc: issue_jwt_pair(user, profile)
    JwtSvc-->>AuthSvc: {access_token, refresh_token} — payload에 user_id + profile_id 둘 다 포함
    AuthRouter2-->>Client: 200 OK, body={access_token}, Set-Cookie: refresh_token(httpOnly)

    Note over Client,DB: 이후 도메인 API(복약/채팅 등)는 get_current_profile 의존성으로<br/>토큰의 profile_id를 바로 꺼내 쓴다 — get_request_user(User 조회)를 거치지 않는다
